    Chapter One - This license usage scenario:

  This license can be used for original projects, 
  distribution projects, commercial releases, and
  personal projects. If the project uses AI techn
  ology to generate content, it should be disclos
  ed.

          Chapter Two - Developer Rights:

  This chapter will lay out the rights of develop
  ers. Developers can freely write and modify cod
  e, but the project can't have any infringement,
  provocation, or anything like that.

         Chapter Three - Modifier Rights:

  This chapter sets out the rights of the modifier.
  Modifier can freely write and modify code, but t
  he project can't have any infringement, provocat
  ion, or anything like that. It must be stated th
  at it's a modification of the original author's 
  project or a project modification based on the o
  riginal work.


